WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.500
 Thank you Maria. Thank you for everything you said so kind and congratulations

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.760
 to the

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:28.660
 fellow inductees. I'm really humbled by your accomplishments and your

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:34.280
 dedication. Congratulations. I have been raised and born in Cleveland and

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:42.200
 have lived in Cleveland all my life. My grandparents came from Hungary, met and

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:48.800
 married in Cleveland and were proud Americans. I have had a

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:56.570
 good fortune of marrying a Hungarian who was born and raised in Hungary. He was

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:03.880
 shot fighting for the freedom of his country in 1956. He

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:11.350
 served five years in the US Army and settled in Cleveland. There is no more

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:25.400
 loyal and proud American than Jim. My work with El Barrio began with the need

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:25.840
 in the

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:34.850
 Hispanic community. My background is in human resources within the company that

00:01:34.850 --> 00:01:44.240
 my husband and I founded in 1970. This led to my chairmanship of the El Barrio

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:53.910
 program and jobs committee. I love to work and I have always loved my work. At

00:01:53.910 --> 00:02:01.520
 El Barrio I worked with people who had the same values and work

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:09.800
 at this. When you are surrounded by people who have a passion for their

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:18.970
 heritage it is contagious. The Cleveland Hungarian development panel has given

00:02:18.970 --> 00:02:19.800
 back to

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:27.260
 Hungarians in the form of youth programs and scholarships. It is an all

00:02:27.260 --> 00:02:34.840
 volunteer organization that has given more than one million to Hungarian youth.

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:35.880
 The

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:43.350
 Hungarian cultural center of Northeastern Ohio and the Hungarian heritage

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:50.160
 museum carry on the Hungarian tradition in their Hungarian village and also

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:50.160
 their

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:59.670
 museum. I have wonderful role models in the Hungarian cultural garden. We have

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:12.760
 members who have dedicated a lifetime to the garden. A past inductee Ernie Meeha.

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:15.120
 We have

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:23.820
 members who have danced as children and took part in the garden dedication in

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:36.360
 1938. Another past inductee Jenny Brown. We also have many young people who

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:37.880
 work along with us

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:49.600
 today such as the Raddick's who are here tonight. You don't need to be a first

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:57.800
 generation or even speak the language of your ancestors to carry on their

00:03:57.800 --> 00:04:07.310
 heritage. Love of tradition comes from the heart. Music and arts are universal

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:15.880
 in language and bring us all together. My work in the Hungarian cultural

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:26.890
 garden is a labor of love. The garden is 78 years old, 78 years young and is in

00:04:26.890 --> 00:04:36.080
 the midst of a restoration project. The garden's legacy wall tells the story of

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:36.280
 the

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:45.830
 cultural arts of Hungarian. It is the first new installation in nearly 50 years.

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:55.400
 We filled our garden with the music of Hungarian composers and musicians. Our

00:04:55.400 --> 00:05:05.200
 annual concert in the garden is free and open to all. Our ancestors in 1938

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:13.810
 created this garden for the benefit of all Clevelanders. As we pass this

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:15.080
 treasure to

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:24.500
 a new generation we pay homage and thanks to our ancestors. In the cultural

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:33.320
 garden we are surrounded by people who are passionate about their heritage.

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:35.000
 There are

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:43.760
 currently 29 active gardens in the federation and their number is growing. The

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:51.400
 Cleveland Cultural Gardens is one of the best and most unique assets of

00:05:51.400 --> 00:05:53.000
 Cleveland.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:06:02.560
 As was mentioned earlier this is a special year for the Cultural Gardens as

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:13.410
 they celebrate their 100th anniversary and continue their tradition of peace

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:14.520
 through mutual

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:24.540
 understanding. The cultural garden chain is a living example of cooperation

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:33.800
 among the diverse ethnic communities of Cleveland and a tribute to the greater

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:34.520
 Cleveland

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:44.430
 area as an international city. As the gardens move into their second century we

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:52.930
 will all celebrate with them. We will carry on the tradition of the past 100

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.760
 years and

00:06:54.760 --> 00:07:10.120
 embrace the cultures of the second century of ethnic Clevelanders. Thank you.

